    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>These terms govern your use of Forger Desktop, Forger Cloud, the app catalog, app downloads and updates, ratings, reviews, feedback, backups, paired devices, remote access sessions, Google/Gmail tools, AI-assisted workflows, automations, and related services. By using Forger, you agree to these terms.</p>

    <h2>Local apps</h2>
